                               ---------------- COMMENTS ----------------
                               Input file (NEC-2) for an interlaced combination of a 2-element yagi (40 m)
                               and a 3-element (20 m). This is a model to give max F/B on the same freq
                               (7 MHz) as measurement done 970524. To achieve this the lenght of the 40 m
                               elements are changed frm 7.355 to 7.22 and 7.105 to 7.11 m.
                               The 20 m elements are the same as that optimized before in NEC-2.
                              PP  2, 1, 0, 0, 0
                                                 For 20 m



